WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.962
Chapter Five.

00:00:01.912 --> 00:00:04.300
The Phoenix Pay Disaster.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:10.475
A 309 million dollar estimate that became a 9.3 billion dollar catastrophe.

00:00:10.475 --> 00:00:14.662
216,000 transactions still backlogged.

00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:18.875
133,000 public servants still affected.

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:24.312
The system won't be fixed until 2031 — fifteen years after it broke.

00:00:24.312 --> 00:00:29.600
The single most expensive information technology failure in Canadian history.
